<title>UK: Peel buys back pref shares at 200p each.</title>
<headline>Peel buys back pref shares at 200p each.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property development group Peel Holdings Plc said on Monday it had bought 100,000 of its 5.25 percent convertible preference shares at a price of 200p per share.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
